.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bathroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/dc8e6dd6-91b8-4ac3-825c-f4b97eb4fde5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1739405/1dc732e1-3919-482d-bade-8cdc93f4f686.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Fully furnished family house near Munich — available January to May 2027\n\nWe are renting out our home for five months while we travel with our children. That is the whole story behind this listing: it is a real family house, lived in and looked after, and we will be back at the end of May.\n\nMove in with a suitcase. The house is completely furnished and equipped, down to bed linen, towels, kitchenware, a cot, a high chair and the rest of the baby equipment. The kitchen has an oven, hob, fridge, dishwasher, washing machine and dryer. There is fibre internet. Nothing to buy, nothing to organise, no furniture rental, no waiting for a delivery slot.\n\nThe house. 150 m2 across 7 rooms, including 3 bedrooms with 3 beds and two children's rooms with toys. Two bathrooms. Cellar and storage, balcony, and a roof terrace on the garage. The garden is 300 m2 and belongs to the house alone — not shared, not overlooked — with a terrace for eating outside. Plot size 500 m2. A private parking space and garage come with it.\n\nThe location. Sauerlach is a quiet village in the Munich district, and the point of it is that you do not need a car. The S-Bahn station is a five-minute walk and puts you at Munich Ostbahnhof in about 20 minutes. Supermarkets, bakeries, restaurants, doctors, kindergarten and school are all within walking distance in the village.\n\nMunich International School in Starnberg/Percha runs an extensive bus network across the region — worth calling their transport office to confirm the stop for this address.\n\nTerms.\n\nAvailable 1 January to 31 May 2027, fixed term, five months\nRent: €2,700 base + €760 utilities advance = €3,460 per month\nUtilities advance covers heating (district heating), water, sewage and electricity — settled against meter readings after the tenancy ends\nDeposit: see below, flexible — bank guarantee, employer guarantee or advance payment all work\nEndreinigung inklusive · Non-smoking house\nPets by arrangement\nBuilt 1968, renovated 2002, energy efficiency class C, [Ausweisart], [Kennwert] kWh/(m2·a), district heating\n\nWho this suits. A family or a couple relocating to Munich for a fixed assignment, a sabbatical of your own, a house renovation, or a first landing period while you look for something permanent. Corporate lets welcome — we are happy to contract with your employer.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"499"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":346000,"deposit":450000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"3460.00","deposit":"4500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":5,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"2027-05-31","from":"2027-01-01"},{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2028-09-01"}],"updated":"2026-09-10T09:37:00Z","__utId__":"ut1739405"}]